Oishikunaare-Moe-Moe-Kyun README · Voices, in three languages：To add a voice, edit the shipped table or point the layer at your own copy:

```json
{
  "voices": [
    { "id": "mine", "label": "mine", "feel": "what it sounds like",
      "markers": ["one", "two"], "asides": ["occasionally"], "use": "when it fits" }

Oishikunaare-Moe-Moe-Kyun README · The kaomoji library：```json
{
  "categories": [
    { "id": "mine", "label": "mine", "use": "when to reach for these",
      "faces": [{ "face": "(your face)", "feel": "what it signals" }] }

Oishikunaare-Moe-Moe-Kyun README · 三语语气表：```json
{
  "voices": [
    { "id": "mine", "label": "我的", "feel": "听起来是什么样",
      "markers": ["呀", "呢"], "asides": ["偶尔来一句"], "use": "什么时候用" }
